# One YouTube channel per line (copy to config/youtube_channels.txt).
# Formats:
#   UCxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#   https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxxxx
#   https://www.youtube.com/@handle
#
# How to collect your subscriptions:
#   - Open https://www.youtube.com/feed/channels in the browser
#   - Right-click each channel → copy link, paste below
#   - Or close Chrome on Windows, then run:
#       python scripts/sync_youtube_feeds.py
#     (uses yt-dlp + fresh cookies / Windows Chrome profile)

# Example (replace with your channels):
# https://www.youtube.com/@MKBHD
# https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_x5XG1OV2P6uZZ5FSM9Ttw
